Cesta 3A: Static build with Conda (build_static.sh)
============================================================
  -d                    Increase debug level
  --staging-dir=PATH    Set staging directory (default: /tmp/balikar_staging)
  --root=PATH           Set target root for install/remove (default: /)
  --no-staging          Disable staging, install directly (stable mode)
  --dry-run             Simulate without changes
  --no-deps             Download without dependencies
  --repo=PATH           Override repository path
  --output-dir=PATH     Output directory for download command
  --local-package=PATH  Install from local tar.bz2 (out of repo)
  --pkg=NAME            Package name for clean-cache command
  -h, --help            Show this help

Examples:
  balikar install glibc
  balikar build gcc --staging-dir=/tmp/stage
  balikar download nmap --output-dir=/tmp/downloads
  balikar download gzip --no-deps
  balikar repo list
  balikar repo add myrepo https://example.com/repo
  balikar clean-cache --pkg=glibc
  balikar install --local-package=/path/to/gzip.tar.bz2

To install:
  sudo cp ./balikar-static /usr/local/bin/balikar
  sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/balikar
